  "description": "Determine if a binary tree is height-balanced (difference between depths of two subtrees is at most 1).",
  "pseudocode": "1: function checkHeight(node) {\n2:   if (!node) return 0;\n3:   left = checkHeight(node.left);\n4:   right = checkHeight(node.right);\n5:   if (left == -1 || right == -1 || abs(left - right) > 1) return -1;\n6:   return max(left, right) + 1;\n7: }",
